  "display_fullname": "Stalker Defense Fiery Aura Consume",
  "display_help": "You can drain body heat from all nearby foes, and even from the air itself, increasing your health, resistance against endurance drain, as well as replenishing your own Endurance. The more foes affected, the more Endurance is gained. Foes suffer minimal Fire damage.<br><br><color #fcfc95>Notes: This power has adaptive recharge. It has a base recharge of <color #FF7F27>10</color> seconds and each affected foe will increase the recharge by <color #FF7F27>5</color> seconds for a maximum total of <color #FF7F27>60</color> seconds.</color>",
